+# Performance History
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured on a 5k-record store (p50).
+
+| State | p50 latency |
+| --- | --- |
+| Before: `quick_check` on the read path | 11.9 ms |
+| After: `quick_check` off the read path, `fts_rows` counter added, body `CHECK` added | 1.05 ms |
+
+The "after" change moved `quick_check` off the `SessionStart` read path (it now
+only runs at session end and its result is cached in `meta`, see
+`crates/muninn-core/src/db.rs` `record_quick_check` / `crates/muninn-core/src/health.rs`),
+and added the trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter plus a body `CHECK`
+constraint at the same time.
+
+Source: recorded episode from this project's own transcripts (muninn
+trust-1, tool_observed), not re-measured in this session.
